<title>SINGAPORE: Zagro 1st half net up 10.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Zagro 1st half net up 10.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     2.87   vs    2.61</p>
<p>    Turnover			37.84   vs   28.03</p>
<p>    Interest expenses	    0.22   vs    0.19</p>
<p>    Pretax			   3.93   vs    3.51</p>
<p>    Tax				1.16   vs    1.06</p>
<p>Note- Zagro Asia Ltd did not give group earnings per share. - Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
